  "note": "Registry of GPUs LocalMax recognises. `highest_tier_alone` is the largest tier one of these cards can fill by itself. It is computed from VRAM and is not a market segment: an RTX 4080 SUPER has 16 GB, so alone it reaches Entry only, and two of them reach Enthusiast. Tier eligibility is computed from TOTAL VRAM across the GPUs in a system, not from a single card, so 2x RTX PRO 6000 qualifies for Prospector. A cluster counts the same way: 8 DGX Sparks are one Prospector system. Every bandwidth and VRAM figure must cite a manufacturer specification in `source`; entries marked source 'unverified' are used for display only and are excluded from any bandwidth-normalised view until confirmed.",
